NAME
    CXC::Astro::Regions - Astronomical region support

VERSION
    version 0.05

DESCRIPTION
    CXC::Astro::Regions provides support for specifying and manipulating
    descriptions of regions used in astronomical software.

SUPPORT
  Bugs
    Please report any bugs or feature requests to
    bug-cxc-astro-regions@rt.cpan.org or through the web interface at:
    <https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=CXC-Astro-Regions>

  Source
    Source is available at

      https://codeberg.com/CXC-Optics/p5-CXC-Astro-Regions

    and may be cloned from

      https://codeberg.com/CXC-Optics/p5-CXC-Astro-Regions.git

SEE ALSO
    Please see those modules/websites for more information related to this
    module.

    *   CXC::Astro::Regions::DS9

    *   CXC::Astro::Regions::CIAO

    *   CXC::Astro::Regions::CFITSIO

